  1092	    limitations: [
  1093	      'Contract inventory is not functional equivalence, an acceptance denominator reduction or task approval.',
  1094	      'Only committed allowlisted contract sources are read; test bodies, examples, builds, binaries, credentials and user sessions are excluded.',
  1095	      'Utility and test-support package source contracts remain infrastructure closure, never parity PASS.',
  1096	      'No type checker, dependency resolution, runtime-inferred API, plugin boot or generated-doc freshness execution.',
